orion-worker pair --server <https-url> --token <token>
orion-worker run
orion-worker status
orion-worker revoke-local
orion-worker browser install   # only if browser runtime needs provisioning
```

Do not put the long-lived credential on the command line after pairing.

Support environment/config-file automation for tests, but normal production docs should avoid secrets in shell history.

Worker logs:
- safe connection lifecycle;
- safe operation kind/name/request ID;
- no credentials;
- no file contents;
- no clipboard contents;
- no typed text/browser form values.

